  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Setting the ownerId get variable on a REST API ingest request does not work and returns default ownerId value.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "(",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FCR30/REST+API#RESTAPI-ingest)"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FCR30/REST+API#RESTAPI-ingest)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Looks like only a small code fix is required at",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/master/fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/rest/FedoraObjectResource.java#L293"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/master/fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/rest/FedoraObjectResource.java#L293",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Also, it looks like ownerId is coded as ownerID on lines 247 and 283 and might also need to be changed.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
