  "description": "<p>Setting the ownerId get variable on a REST API ingest request does not work and returns default ownerId value.<br/>\n(<a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FCR30/REST+API#RESTAPI-ingest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FCR30/REST+API#RESTAPI-ingest</a>)</p>\n\n<p>Looks like only a small code fix is required at<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/master/fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/rest/FedoraObjectResource.java#L293\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/master/fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/rest/FedoraObjectResource.java#L293</a></p>\n\n<p>Also, it looks like ownerId is coded as ownerID on lines 247 and 283 and might also need to be changed.</p>",
